(; expect 1 --type-lhs ;)
(; Negative control under --type-lhs: under the binders x, y the constraints are Y x == c (c a x) a
   and Y y == c a y (Y a pattern variable, c static).  The first holds for every x, so its instance
   at y, Y y == c (c a y) a, follows (abstraction, weakening, application, beta: firings); with the
   second, c (c a y) a == c a y, whose decomposition equates a and y: no solution. ;)
A : Type.
T : A -> Type.
t : a : A -> T a.
a : A.
c : A -> A -> A.

def d : X : (A -> A -> A) -> Y : (A -> A) -> (x : A -> y : A -> T (c (c (c a x) a) (c a y))) -> Type.
[X, Y] d (x => y => X x y) (y => Y y) (x => y => t (c (Y x) (Y y))) --> A.
